cgic 库中处理用户输入时的缓冲区边界检查缺陷。如无法升级，可在调用 cgiFormString、cgiFormStringNoNewlines 等函数前自行对输入长度做上限校验，确保不超过目标缓冲区大小。同时建议在编译时启用栈保护选项（-fstack-protector）以增加利用难度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0392"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0629.toml"}]